{"id":"0e4d04822974c002","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-gl-consistency.md","title":"GL Consistency","display":"df-gl-consistency — GL Consistency","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-gl-consistency","aliases":["89-df-gl-consistency"],"display":"df-gl-consistency — GL Consistency","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-logic]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-gl-consistency"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-gl-consistency</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gl-consistency — GL Consistency"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Consistent}_{G\\!L}\">\\(\\mathrm{Consistent}_{G\\!L}\\)</span> 是下述定义的 GL 句法一致性性质缩写，使用上述固定 GL 公式集。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Consistent}_{G\\!L}\\Longleftrightarrow\\bot\\notin\\mathrm{GL}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Consistent}_{G\\!L}\\Longleftrightarrow\\bot\\notin\\mathrm{GL}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>GL是一致的模态逻辑</li>\n<li>GL不能证明所有公式</li>\n<li>句法一致性本身不推出语义可靠性；GL 的可靠性需要另行证明</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ (see [[89-df-gl-logic]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Consistent}_{G\\!L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Consistent}_{G\\!L}\\Longleftrightarrow\\bot\\notin\\mathrm{GL}.","display":true}],"bytes":763,"backlinks":[{"id":"3987a9cfc50008a9","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-275","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-consistency]]"}],"outgoing":["0006800fa1c85177"]}